caping the city, and are now trapped here. Find weapons to survive as long as possible against the ridden, including a boss fight and parasite enemies. The ridden have one big weakness, their limbs fall off easily! Dismember and ragdoll the zombies and show them why they are actually trapped here with you...", "short_description": "Zombie survival chaos - dismemberment, ragdolls and violence!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.innoverse.co.uk/privacy-policy-ridden", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Innoverse", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.innoverse.co.uk/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1968475266678908"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75295893_3372226636437325_7751623746559144977_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AtxBZ-Jo2ToQ7kNvwHyMzRS&_nc_oc=AdlzOToMeT9SyOdGlcBxOoHjrt9IPfD0TQAdoHQjkA2zWo0mH2XHJgkkU3BHlCMF7mE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzxqJ3Ir9N_YovR8soFXMcTfmWuEpYSww_lFtRwcotQ2w&oe=69B16E49"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Frenzy: The Ridden", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925